       "text": "I didn't enter this order. Amlodipine 50 mg once daily is five times the labeled maximum daily dose of 10 mg, and I can't enter a dose above that limit.\n\nHere are some options:\n- **Enter the labeled maximum:** I can order amlodipine 10 mg by mouth once daily. Usual dosing starts at 5 mg and goes up to 10 mg.\n- **Enter a different dose:** Tell me the dose you want, as long as it's within the labeled range.\n- **Check for a typo:** If you meant 5 mg, I can enter that.\n\nIf the patient needs more blood pressure control than 10 mg gives, adding a second agent from another class is the usual approach. Your pharmacy team can help with that.\n\nWhich dose should I enter?"
      }
